{"t": 1794106814.5489135, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout/promo.py` (`normalize_code`).\n\n- Codes are now normalised before lookup: surrounding whitespace stripped, all inner whitespace removed, and the result upper-cased (`\" autumn 24 \"` -> `\"AUTUMN24\"`).\n- Verified against the failing Android inputs from production (`' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'`, `' Autumn  24 '`, tabs/newlines); all now map to `AUTUMN24`.\n- Production error: Sentry `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (2,940 events, Android 15 / app 8.2).\n\nNo other call sites required changes.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
